WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.662
Day 10. The Final Check.

2
00:00:02.112 --> 00:00:07.069
Day ten is the final check. Your child uses their page. You mark yours.

3
00:00:07.519 --> 00:00:14.163
Say the sentence on your page twice. Your child writes it. Then a sentence about the new picture. Do not help.

4
00:00:14.763 --> 00:00:20.466
Mark the five things for each, then read the box on your page. Put it beside the day one page.

5
00:00:21.066 --> 00:00:27.459
Scan the code to see the report. What comes next: two or three sentences about one thing, every day.
